3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af72ECva8d2eWj36mw_HfWFplyTUjNzrEmODcSx864oGrg&oe=6A11B29A"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1320544502313929", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75278189_1320544505647262_7322829517315090882_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FYDlX56jMDEQ7kNvwGAeMOL&_nc_oc=AdpSfu1mnfvSw3vT6kyA-e2nirGPKPuo6YWFb5nlPJBuZDThRu28laQVQX6tRIF7Q7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5EgMwHuLZ8DtXbAC7j8artB0Q61LJBbAYBjT9_Vg9MuA&oe=6A11AABB"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1734844490691892", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974844_1734844494025225_778535308743462438_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cQpQJRiUtgIQ7kNvwG5TX3b&_nc_oc=Adqxq92bchIY6PwnrJOORR425HqaHPZQwJ03i4XiIKmnws-GHtSyS-wgw9qQ3MsTt3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6MINN6S6ORXV6QNe2o3p53h7WcdYu8QAZURIHU_F3GHw&oe=6A11BC01"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440_CoverLandscape (1).png", "id": "473024245842426", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982620_473024249175759_566385611604994110_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ppMrRtuzdXIQ7kNvwHvpdgl&_nc_oc=AdoYS9rTIXVYERxrp0p5bIriW26zCr0JKdSrOj3JpBrvvZ1OfcuAeAUXJUhKyp44Fzg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af55ay2J0390g51LMCpI2oOlQXk8TUN_l5T09C1K8OQyxQ&oe=6A11B5CB"}, "display_name": "Euphoria Beats", "keywords": ["Immersive", "competitive", "Music", "Dance", "Engaging"], "long_description": "**Dance Deep Dive**\n\n**Euphoria Beats VR** is an immersive rhythm-based VR experience that invites players to express themselves through dance and movement. Designed for players of all skill levels, the game focuses on its **Casual Mode**, offering a vibrant, low-pressure environment to unwind, groove, and have fun.\n\nIn **Euphoria Beats VR**, players can explore two dynamic and visually stunning environments: \n\n- **Pub Dance Floor**: Step into a neon-lit bar, alive with energy and rhythm. Dance across a glowing, reflective floor while interactive props like vibrant lights respond to your every move. The warm golden and cyan hues create a welcoming social atmosphere where players can relax and dance to the beat.  \n   \n- **Abstract Space**: Enter a surreal, dreamlike world filled with floating geometric shapes, glowing orbs, and fluid visuals that pulse with the rhythm. The vivid magenta and cyan tones provide a creative escape, letting players lose themselves in a limitless, artistic dance experience.\n\nFrom hitting glowing rhythm points to creating trails of light with every movement, the first-person gameplay ensures total immersion. Whether you're seeking a relaxed dance session or a creative outlet, *Euphoria Beats VR* delivers a visually rich and rhythm-synced experience that celebrates the joy of music, movement, and freedom of expression.", "short_description": "Euphoria Beats VR is an immersive rhythm-based VR game that lets you dance your way through vibrant environments. Featuring Casual Mode, players can groove freely in two unique settings: the neon-lit Pub Dance Floor, exuding lively social vibes, and the surreal Abstract Space, a dreamlike world of glowing shapes and dynamic colors. With first-person gameplay and beat-synced visuals, Euphoria Beats VR offers a relaxing, expressive experience for players of all skill levels."}]}, "developer_name": "Biswa Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.biswagames.com/privacy_policy/euphoriabeats/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Biswa Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.biswagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}],